  "notes": "{苦|くる}しめる is a transitive ichidan verb meaning to torment or cause suffering to someone.\n\nTRANSITIVE/INTRANSITIVE PAIR:\n- {苦|くる}しめる (⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧): to torment, cause suffering\n- ⟦{苦|くる}しむ→苦しむ：01938_kurushimu⟧ (⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧): to suffer\n\nCOMMON SUBJECTS:\n- ⟦{病気|びょうき}→病気：00771_byouki⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧〜⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{苦|くる}しめる: illness torments ~\n- ⟦{悩|なや}み→悩み：06650_nayami⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧〜⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{苦|くる}しめる: worries torment ~\n- ⟦{思|おも}い{出|で}→思い出：00331_omoide⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧〜⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{苦|くる}しめる: memories torment ~\n\nUSAGE:\nCan have people, illnesses, memories, or abstract concepts as the subject causing the suffering.",
